    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO WISHLIST!</h1><p></p><br><h1>SKIBIDI SKIBIDI SKIBIDI</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689230/extras/10a00b8f98302b922062d0fe78afcb50.poster.avif?t=1749461132\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689230/extras/10a00b8f98302b922062d0fe78afcb50.webm?t=1749461132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689230/extras/10a00b8f98302b922062d0fe78afcb50.mp4?t=1749461132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>FURRY BACKROOMS is a cooperative horror game for 1-8 players, as well as a single-player mode.<br><br>The PLAYER \u043f\u043e\u043f\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0435\u0442 into an unknown anomaly and is transferred to creepy and atmospheric rooms - the BACKROOMS. Here you will be met by a terrible and dangerous FURRY who can do something bad to you! I do not recommend meeting him... Or do I?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689230/extras/8ef0696c76e80d37ca7bd5b5813e879c.poster.avif?t=1749461132\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689230/extras/8ef0696c76e80d37ca7bd5b5813e879c.webm?t=1749461132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689230/extras/8ef0696c76e80d37ca7bd5b5813e879c.mp4?t=1749461132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Gather your friends to go through these terribly tense rooms together and meet the FURRY!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect from the game?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Minimalistic interface, realistic graphics and oppressive atmosphere will provide a complete immersion in the world of FURRY BACKROOMS.<br></li><li>Cooperative mode will allow you and your friends to fully experience the atmosphere. Try to escape from the FURRY!<br></li><li>BACKROOMS are fraught with danger. Various liminal spaces will break your brain.<br></li><li>Regular updates - adding new locations and mechanics.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689230/extras/10a00b8f98302b922062d0fe78afcb50.poster.avif?t=1749461132\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689230/extras/10a00b8f98302b922062d0fe78afcb50.webm?t=1749461132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689230/extras/10a00b8f98302b922062d0fe78afcb50.mp4?t=1749461132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>FURRY BACKROOMS is a cooperative horror game for 1-8 players, as well as a single-player mode.<br><br>The PLAYER \u043f\u043e\u043f\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0435\u0442 into an unknown anomaly and is transferred to creepy and atmospheric rooms - the BACKROOMS. Here you will be met by a terrible and dangerous FURRY who can do something bad to you! I do not recommend meeting him... Or do I?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689230/extras/8ef0696c76e80d37ca7bd5b5813e879c.poster.avif?t=1749461132\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689230/extras/8ef0696c76e80d37ca7bd5b5813e879c.webm?t=1749461132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689230/extras/8ef0696c76e80d37ca7bd5b5813e879c.mp4?t=1749461132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Gather your friends to go through these terribly tense rooms together and meet the FURRY!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect from the game?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Minimalistic interface, realistic graphics and oppressive atmosphere will provide a complete immersion in the world of FURRY BACKROOMS.<br></li><li>Cooperative mode will allow you and your friends to fully experience the atmosphere. Try to escape from the FURRY!<br></li><li>BACKROOMS are fraught with danger. Various liminal spaces will break your brain.<br></li><li>Regular updates - adding new locations and mechanics.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "FURRY BACKROOMS is a cooperative game for a group of 1-8 players that combines the best ideas from the BACKROOMS and FURRY universes. Single mode is also available. You have to survive and find a way out before the FURRY catches up with you. Updates and various interesting things await you...",
